(179362, 10105, 368, '<td valign="top">OMG ... this is just weird to see (in a good way though).. this is practically in my backyard ... great capture of family vacation!!!</td>', 'OMG ... this is just weird to see (in a good way though).. this is practically in my backyard ... great capture of family vacation!!!', '2002-12-30 00:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
