(179477, 10276, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can assure you this will be in my favorites.  I keep missing this photo.  By the time I get the camera out, they are gone.  This is georgeous and a 10 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'I can assure you this will be in my favorites.  I keep missing this photo.  By the time I get the camera out, they are gone.  This is georgeous and a 10 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-30 01:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(179479, 10336, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome airport shot at night.  Beautiful job.  Can''t find anything wrong with this one.  It''s a solid 10.  PTL</td>', 'This is an awesome airport shot at night.  Beautiful job.  Can''t find anything wrong with this one.  It''s a solid 10.  PTL', '2002-12-30 01:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(179481, 10128, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo.  I''m glad for you.  I like the light from behind showing the colors.  Great job.  and God bless you.  a 10 is right on.  PTL</td>', 'This is an awesome photo.  I''m glad for you.  I like the light from behind showing the colors.  Great job.  and God bless you.  a 10 is right on.  PTL', '2002-12-30 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(179491, 10248, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is a great depiction of travel.  There is a lot of jpeg compression in this one.  Some of the back headstones looks partly in focus and partly blurred.  I would suggest saving as close to 150 K as you can, you saved it around 100K.  I gave you a 7</td>', 'This is a great depiction of travel.  There is a lot of jpeg compression in this one.  Some of the back headstones looks partly in focus and partly blurred.  I would suggest saving as close to 150 K as you can, you saved it around 100K.  I gave you a 7', '2002-12-30 01:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(179496, 10199, 51167, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2002-12-30 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(179498, 10105, 5759, '<td valign="top">wish this was bigger, but still great pic.</td>', 'wish this was bigger, but still great pic.', '2002-12-30 01:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(179500, 10328, 51167, '<td valign="top">from the thumb I thought these were real.  I love the shot, just wish that they were real. 9</td>', 'from the thumb I thought these were real.  I love the shot, just wish that they were real. 9', '2002-12-30 01:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(179501, 10271, 51167, '<td valign="top">he only has one leg!.  I like how only one is in focus and the rest is blurred.</td>', 'he only has one leg!.  I like how only one is in focus and the rest is blurred.', '2002-12-30 01:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(179503, 10337, 51167, '<td valign="top">beautiful rich colors.  Your shot is suffering from major compression.  Try to save it as close to 150K as you can.  It is a beautiful shot.</td>', 'beautiful rich colors.  Your shot is suffering from major compression.  Try to save it as close to 150K as you can.  It is a beautiful shot.', '2002-12-30 01:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(179504, 10280, 352, '<td valign="top">This might be improved if the boats were more prominent.  As it is, there are too many points of emphasis fighting for "look at me" status.  The sky, the water, and the boats.</td>', 'This might be improved if the boats were more prominent.  As it is, there are too many points of emphasis fighting for "look at me" status.  The sky, the water, and the boats.', '2002-12-30 02:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
