(179520, 10202, 5892, '<td valign="top">I like that the picture feels as though it''s on eye level with the biker. Good offcenter subject, emphasizing the road. Nice colors.</td>', 'I like that the picture feels as though it''s on eye level with the biker. Good offcenter subject, emphasizing the road. Nice colors.', '2002-12-30 02:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
