(179526, 10170, 5892, '<td valign="top">The detail is amazing - I can see every hair on his little body. I like the contrast between the brown grass that is in focus, and the green grass in the background. Nice job!</td>', 'The detail is amazing - I can see every hair on his little body. I like the contrast between the brown grass that is in focus, and the green grass in the background. Nice job!', '2002-12-30 03:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
