(179540, 10222, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and composition.  I really like how the plane is taking off.  Fantastic capture.  10</td>', 'Excellent colour and composition.  I really like how the plane is taking off.  Fantastic capture.  10', '2002-12-30 03:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
