(179582, 10147, 3942, '<td valign="top">IMHO the black frame is too wide for this (apart from it) nice shot. The black border doesn''t match to the spirit of lightness, freedom and wideness in the shot. But that''s just me...</td>', 'IMHO the black frame is too wide for this (apart from it) nice shot. The black border doesn''t match to the spirit of lightness, freedom and wideness in the shot. But that''s just me...', '2002-12-30 06:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179584, 10168, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but unfortunately it looks oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Nice picture, but unfortunately it looks oversharpened to me.', '2002-12-30 06:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(179585, 10169, 3942, '<td valign="top">Really great idea! But unfortunately the bearing of your model looks (IMHO!) not very nice. When a person is walking try to shoot exactly in the moment, when both legs  are on the earth. Otherwise they look mostly like a stork ;-). The use of the rule of thirds probably would have been helpful too.</td>', 'Really great idea! But unfortunately the bearing of your model looks (IMHO!) not very nice. When a person is walking try to shoot exactly in the moment, when both legs  are on the earth. Otherwise they look mostly like a stork ;-). The use of the rule of thirds probably would have been helpful too.', '2002-12-30 06:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(179586, 10165, 3469, '<td valign="top">Perfect, that how I feel when I get tired driving long hours</td>', 'Perfect, that how I feel when I get tired driving long hours', '2002-12-30 06:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(179587, 10160, 3942, '<td valign="top">Really well done and a highly impressive shot. But IMHO the wide black frame is too much and highly disturbing.</td>', 'Really well done and a highly impressive shot. But IMHO the wide black frame is too much and highly disturbing.', '2002-12-30 06:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(179590, 10328, 2363, '<td valign="top">Great pic - it really looks like they''re causing the splashes! I would have tried not to crop out the top of the front horse''s ear though.</td>', 'Great pic - it really looks like they''re causing the splashes! I would have tried not to crop out the top of the front horse''s ear though.', '2002-12-30 07:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(179591, 10177, 2363, '<td valign="top">I would have put the mast of the left boat a bit further left to follow the rule of thirds. Rather grainy. Rigging very pixelated.</td>', 'I would have put the mast of the left boat a bit further left to follow the rule of thirds. Rather grainy. Rigging very pixelated.', '2002-12-30 07:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(179592, 10148, 2363, '<td valign="top">Is the aeroplane made of netting too then? ;-)</td>', 'Is the aeroplane made of netting too then? ;-)', '2002-12-30 07:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179594, 10101, 2363, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! :-) Shame about the noisy sky</td>', 'Cool idea! :-) Shame about the noisy sky', '2002-12-30 07:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
