(179710, 10260, 5515, '<td valign="top">Wish I had taken this one. My first (and only) 8 so far. Excellent job. I love the shadows and the contrast in this image. I would have prefered to see the whites in the lighthouse a little brighter. If there was more of that I would have scored it a 9. <br/> <br/>In any event this is an excellent image and one I would love to have hanging on my wall. <br/> <br/>Where was this?</td>', 'Wish I had taken this one. My first (and only) 8 so far. Excellent job. I love the shadows and the contrast in this image. I would have prefered to see the whites in the lighthouse a little brighter. If there was more of that I would have scored it a 9.  In any event this is an excellent image and one I would love to have hanging on my wall.  Where was this?', '2002-12-30 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
