(180147, 10317, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  The case looks well loved.  Perhaps you could have tried putting the case into context somewhere (wardrobe maybe) rather than cropping is so tightly - the crop makes it harder to identify because it has no depth.</td>', 'Good photo.  The case looks well loved.  Perhaps you could have tried putting the case into context somewhere (wardrobe maybe) rather than cropping is so tightly - the crop makes it harder to identify because it has no depth.', '2002-12-30 21:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
