(180151, 10140, 1647, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo - I guess the cars and bridge qualify for the travel but I think the photo is a nice scenic photo on it''s own.</td>', 'A very nice photo - I guess the cars and bridge qualify for the travel but I think the photo is a nice scenic photo on it''s own.', '2002-12-30 21:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(180153, 10237, 1647, '<td valign="top">Should I critique this photo or not?  Hmm, there is a bit of shadow on the bottom left corner (your head perhaps). There are also a couple of marks on the paper which are slightly distracting.  Hmm, were you expecting that?</td>', 'Should I critique this photo or not?  Hmm, there is a bit of shadow on the bottom left corner (your head perhaps). There are also a couple of marks on the paper which are slightly distracting.  Hmm, were you expecting that?', '2002-12-30 21:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(180155, 10261, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-12-30 21:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180156, 10271, 1647, '<td valign="top">The background is quite nice, however I find the blurred person a little too distracting.  Perhaps combining a flash would have them frozen at the beginning and then blurred like they are moving away?</td>', 'The background is quite nice, however I find the blurred person a little too distracting.  Perhaps combining a flash would have them frozen at the beginning and then blurred like they are moving away?', '2002-12-30 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
