(180165, 10188, 327, '<td valign="top">I can''t fault this shot at all........love all of it. I know several places that look just like this..........love it. YOU win.</td>', 'I can''t fault this shot at all........love all of it. I know several places that look just like this..........love it. YOU win.', '2002-12-30 21:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
