(180187, 10163, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - recolouring it to sepia seems to have worked well in this case.  The clouds are great and the framing of the propellor is very good.</td>', 'Nice photo - recolouring it to sepia seems to have worked well in this case.  The clouds are great and the framing of the propellor is very good.', '2002-12-30 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(180188, 10332, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely photo.  It feels very Australian (to a local at least).  Lovely colours and composition.</td>', 'That''s a lovely photo.  It feels very Australian (to a local at least).  Lovely colours and composition.', '2002-12-30 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(180189, 10240, 1647, '<td valign="top">A very cute photo but I fail to see the "travel" reference - good otherwise.</td>', 'A very cute photo but I fail to see the "travel" reference - good otherwise.', '2002-12-30 22:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(180191, 10132, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The only thing I would do to improve it is to darken the sky a little.</td>', 'Very nice shot. The only thing I would do to improve it is to darken the sky a little.', '2002-12-30 22:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180192, 10167, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - the graininess actually works I think.</td>', 'Nice photo - the graininess actually works I think.', '2002-12-30 22:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(180194, 10170, 1647, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and quality</td>', 'Lovely detail and quality', '2002-12-30 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(180196, 10084, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very effective - lots of atmosphere</td>', 'Very effective - lots of atmosphere', '2002-12-30 22:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(180199, 10184, 4162, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Would like to have seen a bit more, maybe moving back or less cropping could have included more of the fountain and also the top of the tree.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Would like to have seen a bit more, maybe moving back or less cropping could have included more of the fountain and also the top of the tree.', '2002-12-30 22:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(180200, 10235, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow - What is it?  How do I get a ride on it?  It looks like an awesome rollercoaster - even though it probably isn''t.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Wow - What is it?  How do I get a ride on it?  It looks like an awesome rollercoaster - even though it probably isn''t.  Nice photo.', '2002-12-30 22:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(180206, 10217, 4162, '<td valign="top">Love this!! Lighting is a bit harsh, especially on the right of the picture, could have been toned down a bit. Maybe a closer crop of the donkey would have been good</td>', 'Love this!! Lighting is a bit harsh, especially on the right of the picture, could have been toned down a bit. Maybe a closer crop of the donkey would have been good', '2002-12-30 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(180209, 10337, 1135, '<td valign="top">When you have water in the photo you need to make sure that it is level; otherwise this is a great photo. I would like to travel to this place.</td>', 'When you have water in the photo you need to make sure that it is level; otherwise this is a great photo. I would like to travel to this place.', '2002-12-30 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(180211, 10188, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great composition and sharpness. Wonder if less light would have been good here, some areas seem a bit wshed out. Great shot though!</td>', 'Great composition and sharpness. Wonder if less light would have been good here, some areas seem a bit wshed out. Great shot though!', '2002-12-30 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(180213, 10202, 4162, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great idea, and great composition.  Like the use of the complementary borders.</td>', 'Excellent! Great idea, and great composition.  Like the use of the complementary borders.', '2002-12-30 22:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(180214, 10175, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice but I think I would like color better.</td>', 'Nice but I think I would like color better.', '2002-12-30 22:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(180215, 10194, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great lighting here!  Think the border really sets this off well.</td>', 'Great lighting here!  Think the border really sets this off well.', '2002-12-30 22:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180216, 10163, 1135, '<td valign="top">Hope you made it in time for Christmas... Nice shot.</td>', 'Hope you made it in time for Christmas... Nice shot.', '2002-12-30 22:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180218, 10089, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great composition, the snow looks a little grey, maybe a little more adjustment would have helped.</td>', 'Great composition, the snow looks a little grey, maybe a little more adjustment would have helped.', '2002-12-30 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180220, 10314, 4162, '<td valign="top">Cute picture.  Just wondering what the colour cast is on the snow, looks like the white balance has been set for indoor lighting.</td>', 'Cute picture.  Just wondering what the colour cast is on the snow, looks like the white balance has been set for indoor lighting.', '2002-12-30 22:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(180221, 10257, 1135, '<td valign="top">Just a bit over exposed. Looks like a nice place to be though.</td>', 'Just a bit over exposed. Looks like a nice place to be though.', '2002-12-30 23:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(180222, 10249, 4162, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and crisp image.  Great!</td>', 'Very sharp and crisp image.  Great!', '2002-12-30 23:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(180224, 10105, 1135, '<td valign="top">Why so small? Very nice photo.</td>', 'Why so small? Very nice photo.', '2002-12-30 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(180226, 10240, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very cute but I don''t see travel.</td>', 'Very cute but I don''t see travel.', '2002-12-30 23:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(180227, 10205, 1135, '<td valign="top">Looks like a flash photo. I think it would look better in natural light. Try using the light from an open window and a tripod if it''s still too dark. I think you will like it.</td>', 'Looks like a flash photo. I think it would look better in natural light. Try using the light from an open window and a tripod if it''s still too dark. I think you will like it.', '2002-12-30 23:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180231, 10184, 1135, '<td valign="top">Temple Square in SLC? Very nice. I have some from the Mesa Temple too. You can see them at www.pbase.com/rcrawford if you would like.</td>', 'Temple Square in SLC? Very nice. I have some from the Mesa Temple too. You can see them at www.pbase.com/rcrawford if you would like.', '2002-12-30 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(180232, 10228, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The crop is just a bit tight on the boomerang but still one of my top 3.</td>', 'Very nice. The crop is just a bit tight on the boomerang but still one of my top 3.', '2002-12-30 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(180233, 10291, 1135, '<td valign="top">My top pick for the week. Very nice.</td>', 'My top pick for the week. Very nice.', '2002-12-30 23:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(180240, 10188, 92, '<td valign="top">I love the color tone and the angle. This has a beautiful view without being distracting. VERY nice ! = 10 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I love the color tone and the angle. This has a beautiful view without being distracting. VERY nice ! = 10 Shiiizzzam', '2002-12-30 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(180242, 10235, 92, '<td valign="top">Really nice ! I love the balance this photo has. The rail against the white b/w works great. No distracting clouds or wires:) = 9 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Really nice ! I love the balance this photo has. The rail against the white b/w works great. No distracting clouds or wires:) = 9 Shiiizzzam', '2002-12-30 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180262, 10188, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!! I was going for this setup as well, but all my train tracks were covered in snow. You couldn''t tell what the picture was because all the railway ties were buried. I would have lost miserably to this shot. I chose another avenue for my shot. Go for the gold. 10</td>', 'Great shot!!!! I was going for this setup as well, but all my train tracks were covered in snow. You couldn''t tell what the picture was because all the railway ties were buried. I would have lost miserably to this shot. I chose another avenue for my shot. Go for the gold. 10', '2002-12-31 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(180272, 10251, 4648, '<td valign="top">I took several like this flying into Moscow.  Glad to see I''m not the only one who love these shots.  The clouds are beautiful, like a cushion.  The sky is so pristine.  And the details on the wings, the end tilted up to compensate, are superb.  This is a great shot.  Get any coming in at night?  Wonderful shot.  Wishing you the best.  PTL 9</td>', 'I took several like this flying into Moscow.  Glad to see I''m not the only one who love these shots.  The clouds are beautiful, like a cushion.  The sky is so pristine.  And the details on the wings, the end tilted up to compensate, are superb.  This is a great shot.  Get any coming in at night?  Wonderful shot.  Wishing you the best.  PTL 9', '2002-12-31 01:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180276, 10282, 4648, '<td valign="top">Something doesn''t look right and I can''t figure it out.  Maybe too dark on the right bank, and in the bend at the end?  Great dof, beautiful shot, but I think it could use some lightening or maybe a little less contrast.  Just a thought.  Good shot though.  Worth a 7.  PTL</td>', 'Something doesn''t look right and I can''t figure it out.  Maybe too dark on the right bank, and in the bend at the end?  Great dof, beautiful shot, but I think it could use some lightening or maybe a little less contrast.  Just a thought.  Good shot though.  Worth a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-31 01:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(180278, 10128, 2337, '<td valign="top">Unique interputation of the challenge :)  Technically well executed too!  Good job!</td>', 'Unique interputation of the challenge :)  Technically well executed too!  Good job!', '2002-12-31 01:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(180279, 10248, 5684, '<td valign="top">Strikes a chord I don''t like going back to. Which is good I guess if it''s a photograph. Is there a particular reason for the tombstone behind the flag in focus?</td>', 'Strikes a chord I don''t like going back to. Which is good I guess if it''s a photograph. Is there a particular reason for the tombstone behind the flag in focus?', '2002-12-31 01:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180282, 10280, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot but looks more like swimmers than fishing boats.  Oh, they''re taking a break.  I see.  Should have cropped more on the boats since they are your subject, per your title.  Course would hate to lose the beautiful water.  But that was your choice of titles.  Sorry.  Lost points on that.  PTL 6</td>', 'Beautiful shot but looks more like swimmers than fishing boats.  Oh, they''re taking a break.  I see.  Should have cropped more on the boats since they are your subject, per your title.  Course would hate to lose the beautiful water.  But that was your choice of titles.  Sorry.  Lost points on that.  PTL 6', '2002-12-31 01:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180283, 10237, 5684, '<td valign="top">The contrasting blue and white is great. I love the simplicity of the ship.  Since the corner is torn it''s a bit distracting, so I''ll have to only give this a 9.</td>', 'The contrasting blue and white is great. I love the simplicity of the ship.  Since the corner is torn it''s a bit distracting, so I''ll have to only give this a 9.', '2002-12-31 01:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180285, 10180, 5684, '<td valign="top">Being closer to the subject would be better.</td>', 'Being closer to the subject would be better.', '2002-12-31 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180287, 10248, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wish the grave markers had been in focus.  They occupy over half of the shot.  Maybe you were focusing on the hearse.  It''s just that you can see the names enough that your eyes are drawn here trying to read them.  Otherwise it is a great shot.  I just personally think you chose the wrong focal point based on the photo itself.  PTL 5</td>', 'Wish the grave markers had been in focus.  They occupy over half of the shot.  Maybe you were focusing on the hearse.  It''s just that you can see the names enough that your eyes are drawn here trying to read them.  Otherwise it is a great shot.  I just personally think you chose the wrong focal point based on the photo itself.  PTL 5', '2002-12-31 01:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(180288, 10328, 5684, '<td valign="top">It''s certianly an excellent photo, but what''s portrayed in combination with the title doesn''t say travel to me.  Of course that''s only my interpretation.</td>', 'It''s certianly an excellent photo, but what''s portrayed in combination with the title doesn''t say travel to me.  Of course that''s only my interpretation.', '2002-12-31 01:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(180289, 10132, 4648, '<td valign="top">Appears you made the blues.  It''s too much for me, and that is my favorite color.  Here it appears you were trying to add dazzle.  The photo is good with out that.  One thing that really bothers me is the zip of lighting coming in from the upper right.  What is it?  I dolike the reflection in the water, but it was ruined by the colorization process.  Otherwise would be a great shot.  PTL 5</td>', 'Appears you made the blues.  It''s too much for me, and that is my favorite color.  Here it appears you were trying to add dazzle.  The photo is good with out that.  One thing that really bothers me is the zip of lighting coming in from the upper right.  What is it?  I dolike the reflection in the water, but it was ruined by the colorization process.  Otherwise would be a great shot.  PTL 5', '2002-12-31 01:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(180290, 10157, 5684, '<td valign="top">The white cloth is pretty harsh as well as the bottom right.</td>', 'The white cloth is pretty harsh as well as the bottom right.', '2002-12-31 01:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180291, 10276, 5684, '<td valign="top">Sort of reminds me of Escher, without the morph :P</td>', 'Sort of reminds me of Escher, without the morph :P', '2002-12-31 01:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(180292, 10177, 4648, '<td valign="top">Guess you know by now - the sky.  I don''t know what it is technically called, but it''s bad.  I do know that.  I don''t know what caused is or how to get rid of it.  Hopefully someone else will and will tell you.  Otherwise I really liked this photo.  It''s very peaceful and restful.  Shame it''s not better.  PTL 5</td>', 'Guess you know by now - the sky.  I don''t know what it is technically called, but it''s bad.  I do know that.  I don''t know what caused is or how to get rid of it.  Hopefully someone else will and will tell you.  Otherwise I really liked this photo.  It''s very peaceful and restful.  Shame it''s not better.  PTL 5', '2002-12-31 01:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(180293, 10253, 5684, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a good idea but has room for improvement. If you had moved over to the right perhaps about 10 feet, and exposed the photo so that the mountains were darker I think it would look better.</td>', 'I think it''s a good idea but has room for improvement. If you had moved over to the right perhaps about 10 feet, and exposed the photo so that the mountains were darker I think it would look better.', '2002-12-31 01:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(180296, 10247, 5684, '<td valign="top">1) what is it? looks like an arch<br/>2) Noise</td>', '1) what is it? looks like an arch2) Noise', '2002-12-31 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(180297, 10147, 5684, '<td valign="top">Great shot, my only complaint is the noise in my sky, but the subject is so bold that it doesn''t seem to distract.</td>', 'Great shot, my only complaint is the noise in my sky, but the subject is so bold that it doesn''t seem to distract.', '2002-12-31 01:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180298, 10298, 2337, '<td valign="top">At an NBA game I think you could have gotten a much better "traveling" shot :) If you know what I mean :)  Nice shot!</td>', 'At an NBA game I think you could have gotten a much better "traveling" shot :) If you know what I mean :)  Nice shot!', '2002-12-31 01:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(180299, 10311, 5684, '<td valign="top">nice color</td>', 'nice color', '2002-12-31 01:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180300, 10336, 5684, '<td valign="top">love the blurred takeoff lights</td>', 'love the blurred takeoff lights', '2002-12-31 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(180301, 10330, 2337, '<td valign="top">I think fill flash could have made this shot a REAL contender!</td>', 'I think fill flash could have made this shot a REAL contender!', '2002-12-31 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(180308, 10160, 3273, '<td valign="top">The border is too thick but it''s a lovely picture otherwise.</td>', 'The border is too thick but it''s a lovely picture otherwise.', '2002-12-31 02:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(180310, 10257, 3273, '<td valign="top">Looks bright and oversaturated (especially the distant boats).  Nice colour and detail though.</td>', 'Looks bright and oversaturated (especially the distant boats).  Nice colour and detail though.', '2002-12-31 02:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(180354, 10236, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about your subjects, but the picture quality is excellent.  Maybe slightly underexposed, if I had to pick something - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m not crazy about your subjects, but the picture quality is excellent.  Maybe slightly underexposed, if I had to pick something - Inspzil', '2002-12-31 05:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(180375, 10086, 4615, '<td valign="top">hard to imagine a stream as narrow as this being used as a means of travel.  If i saw this photo outside of the challenge I would think, "nature", or "landscape", not "Travel".</td>', 'hard to imagine a stream as narrow as this being used as a means of travel.  If i saw this photo outside of the challenge I would think, "nature", or "landscape", not "Travel".', '2002-12-31 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(180377, 10240, 4615, '<td valign="top">Wvery traveller will see the relavence of this to the travel subject!  Only, it looks like happy screaming, not the irritated, upset, or willful screaming of children on planes and trains that we all know and love.</td>', 'Wvery traveller will see the relavence of this to the travel subject!  Only, it looks like happy screaming, not the irritated, upset, or willful screaming of children on planes and trains that we all know and love.', '2002-12-31 08:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(180379, 10257, 4615, '<td valign="top">Very crowded with detail.</td>', 'Very crowded with detail.', '2002-12-31 08:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(180380, 10131, 4615, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Simple and understated with message clear.  The body looks a bit disproportionate-big torso with tiny legs.</td>', 'I like it.  Simple and understated with message clear.  The body looks a bit disproportionate-big torso with tiny legs.', '2002-12-31 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180382, 10205, 4615, '<td valign="top">could use more lighting.</td>', 'could use more lighting.', '2002-12-31 08:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180383, 10312, 4615, '<td valign="top">Why is the man going in the ladies?</td>', 'Why is the man going in the ladies?', '2002-12-31 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(180384, 10295, 4615, '<td valign="top">Looks like they should have stayed at home this time.</td>', 'Looks like they should have stayed at home this time.', '2002-12-31 08:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(180411, 10121, 2302, '<td valign="top">sorry I don''t have much of a comment on the picture - just wanted to say that I am jealose that you are/were in New Mexico!  I just love it there - so many photo opportunities with such a great sky and beautiful lighting. Nice framing and balance to this shot - I wish the bell tower on the right had a little less shadow.</td>', 'sorry I don''t have much of a comment on the picture - just wanted to say that I am jealose that you are/were in New Mexico!  I just love it there - so many photo opportunities with such a great sky and beautiful lighting. Nice framing and balance to this shot - I wish the bell tower on the right had a little less shadow.', '2002-12-31 10:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180444, 10184, 1003, '<td valign="top">lovely to see......</td>', 'lovely to see......', '2002-12-31 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(180445, 10220, 1135, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for out of focus pictures unless it adds to the mood. In this case it just makes me feel like I need to put on my glasses.</td>', 'I don''t care for out of focus pictures unless it adds to the mood. In this case it just makes me feel like I need to put on my glasses.', '2002-12-31 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(180448, 10237, 1135, '<td valign="top">Don''t be so hard on yourself. As to the photo, it could use more light and what happened to the corner of the paper? I like the crop/composition.</td>', 'Don''t be so hard on yourself. As to the photo, it could use more light and what happened to the corner of the paper? I like the crop/composition.', '2002-12-31 12:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(180451, 10268, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and I like the composition, I wish the photo was sharper though, Good Job.</td>', 'Very nice colors and I like the composition, I wish the photo was sharper though, Good Job.', '2002-12-31 12:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180453, 10246, 3705, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2002-12-31 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(180454, 10104, 1135, '<td valign="top">Why did you make it so small? Needs a subject to be more interesting, nice colors though.</td>', 'Why did you make it so small? Needs a subject to be more interesting, nice colors though.', '2002-12-31 12:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180456, 10339, 1135, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for flash photos, makes for a snap shot. I think this would have turned out better if you had used natural light. The floor is very distracting; a tighter crop would make this photo much better.</td>', 'I don''t care for flash photos, makes for a snap shot. I think this would have turned out better if you had used natural light. The floor is very distracting; a tighter crop would make this photo much better.', '2002-12-31 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180458, 10262, 5886, '<td valign="top">This is cool photo. In its thumbnail  version I htought it was a sand dune. It still provokes my imagination when I see it larger. It is almost surreal.</td>', 'This is cool photo. In its thumbnail  version I htought it was a sand dune. It still provokes my imagination when I see it larger. It is almost surreal.', '2002-12-31 12:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
