(180550, 10167, 669, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately your photo came out very dark on my monitor, and even after adjustment in Photoshop it couldn''t be improved a lot.  It looks like it could have been a good photo. :-(</td>', 'Unfortunately your photo came out very dark on my monitor, and even after adjustment in Photoshop it couldn''t be improved a lot.  It looks like it could have been a good photo. :-(', '2002-12-31 16:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
