(180583, 10247, 2003, '<td valign="top">too grainy for my taste, but it still looks like St Louis 4</td>', 'too grainy for my taste, but it still looks like St Louis 4', '2002-12-31 19:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(180592, 10320, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is an Excellent image! Unfortunately there are DPC folk out there that will ding points off you because it is blurred, not dayglo colour, weird angle or something foolish like that. And those are the Exact reasons among many that I believe this is awonderful work. The blur fits the rush of modern travel perfectly. Your choice of angle adds drama and accentuates action. The B&amp;W goes well with the common ratrace situation. But your vision has raised the ordinary into something extraordinary. And so you certainly deserve merit in the top ten. I hope you get many other positive comments from other voters. I am going to give you a 10 to compensate those other people who will give you the instant one second 3 vote.  Please remain loyal to your fantastic insight. Your work is excellent.</td>', 'This is an Excellent image! Unfortunately there are DPC folk out there that will ding points off you because it is blurred, not dayglo colour, weird angle or something foolish like that. And those are the Exact reasons among many that I believe this is awonderful work. The blur fits the rush of modern travel perfectly. Your choice of angle adds drama and accentuates action. The B&W goes well with the common ratrace situation. But your vision has raised the ordinary into something extraordinary. And so you certainly deserve merit in the top ten. I hope you get many other positive comments from other voters. I am going to give you a 10 to compensate those other people who will give you the instant one second 3 vote.  Please remain loyal to your fantastic insight. Your work is excellent.', '2002-12-31 21:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(180594, 10260, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is one heck of an image. I say chuck away all those tinsel town glamour shots. And sink your eyeballs into something with real merit like this fabulous work. I am in quivering rapture from the feel of those brooding clouds, the stark two tone lighthouse, the brilliant juxtaposition of grasses and sky tones and the emphatic border. Beautiful is a sheer undestatement here. You must recieve many more compliments upon this image. It is a work of art. I am going to give you a 10 to make up for those other fools who absently knee jerk a 5 score. OK you got me grovelling for more gorgeous B&amp;W in future challenges. I won\''t settle for anything less. Good luck!</td>', 'This is one heck of an image. I say chuck away all those tinsel town glamour shots. And sink your eyeballs into something with real merit like this fabulous work. I am in quivering rapture from the feel of those brooding clouds, the stark two tone lighthouse, the brilliant juxtaposition of grasses and sky tones and the emphatic border. Beautiful is a sheer undestatement here. You must recieve many more compliments upon this image. It is a work of art. I am going to give you a 10 to make up for those other fools who absently knee jerk a 5 score. OK you got me grovelling for more gorgeous B&W in future challenges. I won\''t settle for anything less. Good luck!', '2002-12-31 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(180595, 10151, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely mood image. I really like how you worked the limited tones. Beautiful hue accents. Nice light polygons shooting across the contrasting gray horizontal wall slabs. And of course the piece de resistance, that most incredible pillar buttered with breathtaking hues. A person seated or somewhere in the frame would throw the whole concept off for me. You have captured a wonderful moment. Hope you receive  lots of rave reviews. ...8</td>', 'This is a lovely mood image. I really like how you worked the limited tones. Beautiful hue accents. Nice light polygons shooting across the contrasting gray horizontal wall slabs. And of course the piece de resistance, that most incredible pillar buttered with breathtaking hues. A person seated or somewhere in the frame would throw the whole concept off for me. You have captured a wonderful moment. Hope you receive  lots of rave reviews. ...8', '2002-12-31 21:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(180597, 10229, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good idea but not enough focus.  I do like that is is portrait rather than landscape.  Good choice there.  Just needs to be sharper focused.  PTL 5</td>', 'Good idea but not enough focus.  I do like that is is portrait rather than landscape.  Good choice there.  Just needs to be sharper focused.  PTL 5', '2002-12-31 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(180598, 10159, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need I say more than the score is 2.  l know you have already been hammered about nothing in focus and nothing to look at to be a movement shot.  Good idea just very bad execution.  PTL</td>', 'Need I say more than the score is 2.  l know you have already been hammered about nothing in focus and nothing to look at to be a movement shot.  Good idea just very bad execution.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(180599, 10122, 4648, '<td valign="top">Didn''t you submit this one once before, or one just like it?  I wish I had that lens.  All I get of the moon is a blurry light in the black.  I don''t like all that empty space on the left.  Crop it out, to the same amount on both sides.  That would help it immensely.  As is it is a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Didn''t you submit this one once before, or one just like it?  I wish I had that lens.  All I get of the moon is a blurry light in the black.  I don''t like all that empty space on the left.  Crop it out, to the same amount on both sides.  That would help it immensely.  As is it is a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(180601, 10241, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful BUT.  Don''t you hate to see an all caps BUT?  Pull back and let us see the bridge and the water it is over.  You have less than half a photo.  Also don''t know about the angle, tilting bridge.  Doesn''t do it for me.  Could be a good shot, but not as is.  PTL  4</td>', 'This is beautiful BUT.  Don''t you hate to see an all caps BUT?  Pull back and let us see the bridge and the water it is over.  You have less than half a photo.  Also don''t know about the angle, tilting bridge.  Doesn''t do it for me.  Could be a good shot, but not as is.  PTL  4', '2002-12-31 22:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(180602, 10089, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Where''s the road.  Oh I see, 4 wheeling.  Ha, ha.  If you didn''t have the car there I wouldn''t kow if this was color or B&amp;W.  Glad you left it color.  I also like the TALL tree next to the car.  It just adds depth for me.  This is an 8 for sure.  PTL  Goo job.  Wishing you the best.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Where''s the road.  Oh I see, 4 wheeling.  Ha, ha.  If you didn''t have the car there I wouldn''t kow if this was color or B&W.  Glad you left it color.  I also like the TALL tree next to the car.  It just adds depth for me.  This is an 8 for sure.  PTL  Goo job.  Wishing you the best.', '2002-12-31 22:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(180603, 10290, 4648, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with travel?  How far did you have to go to get this one?  The brick work is out of this world, as is the wroght iron work.  I wish you had zoomed out just a little to let the greenery frame the garden, to give some perspective of the garden in relation to the building.  Can''t tell too much from the sky but looks like you may have lightened it as much as you could.  Maybe lighten a little more by contrast or gamma adjustment.  Those help a lot if you have an exceptionally dark shot.  This could be a georgeous shot at a 9.  As is it is still good at a 6.  PTL</td>', 'What does this have to do with travel?  How far did you have to go to get this one?  The brick work is out of this world, as is the wroght iron work.  I wish you had zoomed out just a little to let the greenery frame the garden, to give some perspective of the garden in relation to the building.  Can''t tell too much from the sky but looks like you may have lightened it as much as you could.  Maybe lighten a little more by contrast or gamma adjustment.  Those help a lot if you have an exceptionally dark shot.  This could be a georgeous shot at a 9.  As is it is still good at a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(180604, 10314, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous.  My turn next.  I love this.  But it does have some problems.  Too dark and the fact that the snow is blue are the biggest problems.  Not sure how you arrived at the blue.  Soft focus is ok and the crop is good.  The expressions on those tiny little faces add a couple of points by themselves.  7 isn''t bad for one with these problems.  PTL</td>', 'I''m jealous.  My turn next.  I love this.  But it does have some problems.  Too dark and the fact that the snow is blue are the biggest problems.  Not sure how you arrived at the blue.  Soft focus is ok and the crop is good.  The expressions on those tiny little faces add a couple of points by themselves.  7 isn''t bad for one with these problems.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180605, 10287, 4648, '<td valign="top">Well?  Where did you end up going?  Get rid of the dark yellow tint and this is fairly good.  Don''t like the grey lower right corner.  Focus a little soft and appears to be a graininess.  But not too bad.  I''ll give it a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Well?  Where did you end up going?  Get rid of the dark yellow tint and this is fairly good.  Don''t like the grey lower right corner.  Focus a little soft and appears to be a graininess.  But not too bad.  I''ll give it a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(180607, 10148, 4648, '<td valign="top">Did the net catch it?  At first I didn''t like this at all.  But kept coming back to it.  It is growing on me.  It''s a little dark.  Right now I''m scoring it a 6.  I''ll keep coming back and who knows where it will end up.  PTL</td>', 'Did the net catch it?  At first I didn''t like this at all.  But kept coming back to it.  It is growing on me.  It''s a little dark.  Right now I''m scoring it a 6.  I''ll keep coming back and who knows where it will end up.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(180608, 10255, 4648, '<td valign="top">OK.  I get it, now.  The angles of items are a little hard on the eyes, and the neck.  Personally I think it is cropped a little too tightly.  Pull back and give yourself some breathing room.  I feel there is no breathing room in this.  Can you understand?`  That''s the major problems I see.  Not bad.  Good thought.  I''ll give it a 6.  PTL</td>', 'OK.  I get it, now.  The angles of items are a little hard on the eyes, and the neck.  Personally I think it is cropped a little too tightly.  Pull back and give yourself some breathing room.  I feel there is no breathing room in this.  Can you understand?`  That''s the major problems I see.  Not bad.  Good thought.  I''ll give it a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180610, 10086, 4648, '<td valign="top">Lighten this up a little and it is a 10.  I love the landscape, the composition, the subject, etc.  The cropping is a little tight on the top, especially on the top right corner.  Could come in just a hair on the left, if you had to, but I''d hate to see you lose than bend in the creek.  Maybe zoom out just a little.  These are just thoughts and suggestions to try later.  For now just lightened would do it.  PTL 8</td>', 'Lighten this up a little and it is a 10.  I love the landscape, the composition, the subject, etc.  The cropping is a little tight on the top, especially on the top right corner.  Could come in just a hair on the left, if you had to, but I''d hate to see you lose than bend in the creek.  Maybe zoom out just a little.  These are just thoughts and suggestions to try later.  For now just lightened would do it.  PTL 8', '2002-12-31 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180614, 10105, 4648, '<td valign="top">I am so torn on this photo.The timing is so fantastic.  The fireworks are awesome.  The portrait shot works well here. Then the bottome falls out of my "wow" and thrill.  There''s something wrong about the castle that I can''t figure out.  Then the photo abruptly cut off.  The crop is a little tight on the top too.  Without showing more of the village, at the bottom of the castle, the white lights are big distractions on each side of the castle.  The people you could see, you''ve cropped off at the head, either in or just below.  Best thing I can figure out is zoom out a little and see if that fixes it.  But I''ll still give it a 5.  PTL</td>', 'I am so torn on this photo.The timing is so fantastic.  The fireworks are awesome.  The portrait shot works well here. Then the bottome falls out of my "wow" and thrill.  There''s something wrong about the castle that I can''t figure out.  Then the photo abruptly cut off.  The crop is a little tight on the top too.  Without showing more of the village, at the bottom of the castle, the white lights are big distractions on each side of the castle.  The people you could see, you''ve cropped off at the head, either in or just below.  Best thing I can figure out is zoom out a little and see if that fixes it.  But I''ll still give it a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-31 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(180615, 10299, 4648, '<td valign="top">You made it look better than it really does.  When you live here you go somewhere else to vacation and take pictures.  This is a really exceptionally good photo with just one problem in my opinion.  The blue tint could stand to be lightened a little for my personal tastes.  Other than that this is poster or postcard quality work. Right now I''m torn between 9 &amp; 10.  Because of the tint I''m going with 9, but may change my mind before Sunday night.  PTL</td>', 'You made it look better than it really does.  When you live here you go somewhere else to vacation and take pictures.  This is a really exceptionally good photo with just one problem in my opinion.  The blue tint could stand to be lightened a little for my personal tastes.  Other than that this is poster or postcard quality work. Right now I''m torn between 9 & 10.  Because of the tint I''m going with 9, but may change my mind before Sunday night.  PTL', '2002-12-31 23:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180617, 10196, 4380, '<td valign="top">i really like the concept.</td>', 'i really like the concept.', '2002-12-31 23:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(180620, 10337, 4380, '<td valign="top">very nice photograph, i love the composition and colours.</td>', 'very nice photograph, i love the composition and colours.', '2002-12-31 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(180623, 10312, 4648, '<td valign="top">You can almost feel her panic - the tight fist, the left foot moving right on, and the way she is holding her sholders up tight.  All travelers can identify with this photo.  Good composition and good execution.  A real nice one, and one of a kind which adds to it.  Can find no problems.  PTL 9</td>', 'You can almost feel her panic - the tight fist, the left foot moving right on, and the way she is holding her sholders up tight.  All travelers can identify with this photo.  Good composition and good execution.  A real nice one, and one of a kind which adds to it.  Can find no problems.  PTL 9', '2002-12-31 23:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(180624, 10140, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice pix, i like the colours and  excellent composition.</td>', 'nice pix, i like the colours and  excellent composition.', '2002-12-31 23:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(180625, 10141, 4648, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I can''t tell a lot from this.  I see tail lights on the car in front of you.  But I can''t tell where the lights on the left are going.  Can''t even tell their direction.  It almost looks like they are aimed at you and the car in front of you.  Nothing on the sides of the road to help figure this out.  Need better execution.  PTL</td>', 'Sorry but I can''t tell a lot from this.  I see tail lights on the car in front of you.  But I can''t tell where the lights on the left are going.  Can''t even tell their direction.  It almost looks like they are aimed at you and the car in front of you.  Nothing on the sides of the road to help figure this out.  Need better execution.  PTL', '2002-12-31 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(180626, 10151, 4648, '<td valign="top">What?  Looks like the chairs are your subject and the rest of the photo a waste.  I don''t understand your title.  Where are these chairs?  Bad shadows.  Poll is very distracting.  Is in focus otherwise.  Too much extra space and too much left to the questions.  Sorry.  PTL 3</td>', 'What?  Looks like the chairs are your subject and the rest of the photo a waste.  I don''t understand your title.  Where are these chairs?  Bad shadows.  Poll is very distracting.  Is in focus otherwise.  Too much extra space and too much left to the questions.  Sorry.  PTL 3', '2002-12-31 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(180645, 10184, 4829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! What a great photo! -8-</td>', 'Beautiful! What a great photo! -8-', '2003-01-01 00:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(180657, 10171, 4829, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this photo was gloom... very sad. Great photo though...-8-</td>', 'My first reaction to this photo was gloom... very sad. Great photo though...-8-', '2003-01-01 02:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180703, 10180, 4615, '<td valign="top">was this your xmas pressie?  nice shot, great location.</td>', 'was this your xmas pressie?  nice shot, great location.', '2003-01-01 10:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(180707, 10137, 4615, '<td valign="top">Okay, so how did you con her into taking her top off?</td>', 'Okay, so how did you con her into taking her top off?', '2003-01-01 10:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180713, 10242, 4615, '<td valign="top">They built a prison right over the road, on an overpass and near a reststop?  Wow.<br/>The photo is dark and moody, better than the title. 7</td>', 'They built a prison right over the road, on an overpass and near a reststop?  Wow.The photo is dark and moody, better than the title. 7', '2003-01-01 10:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(180715, 10249, 4615, '<td valign="top">I wish the train looked this good.</td>', 'I wish the train looked this good.', '2003-01-01 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(180719, 10228, 4615, '<td valign="top">At least there are no corks dangling from her hat.</td>', 'At least there are no corks dangling from her hat.', '2003-01-01 10:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180722, 10328, 4615, '<td valign="top">Every place is a destination for someone, actually or at least potentially, therefore everything is relevant to the subject of travel.  Thus your photo is bang on target!  Good luck and keep rebutting comments.</td>', 'Every place is a destination for someone, actually or at least potentially, therefore everything is relevant to the subject of travel.  Thus your photo is bang on target!  Good luck and keep rebutting comments.', '2003-01-01 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(180729, 10290, 4829, '<td valign="top">Thhihs would have been an awesome photo (not just great :O) if the angle was better, not so tilted. It looks like you were trying to take the photo with what room you had and to get the entire "shot" you had to tilt, or...there was seomthing that you didnt want to be seen in the photo so you tilted up, or I could just be way wrong all together, lol! -7-</td>', 'Thhihs would have been an awesome photo (not just great :O) if the angle was better, not so tilted. It looks like you were trying to take the photo with what room you had and to get the entire "shot" you had to tilt, or...there was seomthing that you didnt want to be seen in the photo so you tilted up, or I could just be way wrong all together, lol! -7-', '2003-01-01 11:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180766, 10337, 4829, '<td valign="top">Where is this located? Quite beautiful for this time of year, lots of green....looks higher up in elevation (evergreens) but no snow...(except for what looks like a few peaks)</td>', 'Where is this located? Quite beautiful for this time of year, lots of green....looks higher up in elevation (evergreens) but no snow...(except for what looks like a few peaks)', '2003-01-01 12:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
