(180868, 10178, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need the whole key to be in focus, in my opinion, with the rest out of focus.  Without the title would not know this was "travel".  Photo should show title, not vice-versa, but I know you''ve already heard that.  All I can give is a 4.  PTL</td>', 'Need the whole key to be in focus, in my opinion, with the rest out of focus.  Without the title would not know this was "travel".  Photo should show title, not vice-versa, but I know you''ve already heard that.  All I can give is a 4.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180869, 10316, 4648, '<td valign="top">How many time have you already heard "What''s with the slant?"  Here it is again.  It''s a fairly good photo except for that and the fact that the whole left side is dark.  Hate that sun glint off the suv, don''t you.  Definitely says travel.  Still worth a 5.  PTL</td>', 'How many time have you already heard "What''s with the slant?"  Here it is again.  It''s a fairly good photo except for that and the fact that the whole left side is dark.  Hate that sun glint off the suv, don''t you.  Definitely says travel.  Still worth a 5.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(180870, 10196, 4648, '<td valign="top">Hope nothing serious was wrong with the car.  Not too sure what I think of this photo.  Can''t tell if a storm is coming or it''s just dark or you made it look dark.  Right now it''s a 5.  Maybe later.  PTL</td>', 'Hope nothing serious was wrong with the car.  Not too sure what I think of this photo.  Can''t tell if a storm is coming or it''s just dark or you made it look dark.  Right now it''s a 5.  Maybe later.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(180871, 10140, 4648, '<td valign="top">And what a view it is.  What city is it?  Shame the sky didn''t have a lot of beautiful blues in it.  Love the shadow on the bank and part of the buildings.  Real nice shot.  Nice 8.  PTL</td>', 'And what a view it is.  What city is it?  Shame the sky didn''t have a lot of beautiful blues in it.  Love the shadow on the bank and part of the buildings.  Real nice shot.  Nice 8.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(180872, 10200, 4648, '<td valign="top">What in the world that has anything to do with travel is PINK?  The circle, maybe a mirror, or the right side is distracting.  Can''t tell what this machine is, or what this is a picture of, the door?, the window?.  Need to be zoomed back some so we can tell.  This just doesn''t get this challenge for me.  Sorry.  PTL 4.  And it really wasn''t that bad of a photo.  Needs some work.</td>', 'What in the world that has anything to do with travel is PINK?  The circle, maybe a mirror, or the right side is distracting.  Can''t tell what this machine is, or what this is a picture of, the door?, the window?.  Need to be zoomed back some so we can tell.  This just doesn''t get this challenge for me.  Sorry.  PTL 4.  And it really wasn''t that bad of a photo.  Needs some work.', '2003-01-01 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(180873, 10291, 5458, '<td valign="top">Good  photo, very nice to look at. But is missing meaning.</td>', 'Good  photo, very nice to look at. But is missing meaning.', '2003-01-01 19:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(180874, 10145, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I had to laugh when I saw this.  The hat over his eyes and the expression on his face are too much.  This is precious.  I just gave it away I''m a woman scoring this (precious).  My biggest problem, and maybe only, is that the chair is leaning to the right, and I find myself leaning with it.  The subject is cute as can be; the focus is right on; the colors are fantastic, the cropping is nice, maybe leave the other side of the chair in also; meets the challenge; and he is wearing a seat belt, TG, and it is on correctly.  Without leaning would be a 10.  As is right now is an 8.  We''ll see later.  PTL</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I had to laugh when I saw this.  The hat over his eyes and the expression on his face are too much.  This is precious.  I just gave it away I''m a woman scoring this (precious).  My biggest problem, and maybe only, is that the chair is leaning to the right, and I find myself leaning with it.  The subject is cute as can be; the focus is right on; the colors are fantastic, the cropping is nice, maybe leave the other side of the chair in also; meets the challenge; and he is wearing a seat belt, TG, and it is on correctly.  Without leaning would be a 10.  As is right now is an 8.  We''ll see later.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(180875, 10266, 4648, '<td valign="top">Have you heard the Christian song, "I wanna be where you are".  Well, that''s my comment to this photo exactly.  Looks like not many people have been there either.  This is an awesome shot.   Can''t say anything against it.  It''s a 10 in my book. and will be among my favorites.  PTL</td>', 'Have you heard the Christian song, "I wanna be where you are".  Well, that''s my comment to this photo exactly.  Looks like not many people have been there either.  This is an awesome shot.   Can''t say anything against it.  It''s a 10 in my book. and will be among my favorites.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180878, 10256, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like how the beach is framed by the pier pillars.  This is a beautiful shot.  The texture in the concrete comes through as clearly as does the shore line.  The timbers on the pier look to need replacing soon.  Good job with great depth.  Nice 10.  PTL</td>', 'I like how the beach is framed by the pier pillars.  This is a beautiful shot.  The texture in the concrete comes through as clearly as does the shore line.  The timbers on the pier look to need replacing soon.  Good job with great depth.  Nice 10.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180879, 10291, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now here is a wonderful 1000 piece puzzle if I ever saw one.  Great reflections of the clouds and boats both.  Only thing I don''t like about it is the dark in the bottom left hand corner.  I know you wanted as much of the reflection of the boat as possible, but I wonder if the dark is worth it.  Personally I would have cropped the dark out, rather than have it spoil an otherwise perfect picture.  Man I hate that dark spot.  But I still like the shot and it''s worth a 9.  PTL  I really want to give a 10 but can''t.  I hate that dark spot........</td>', 'Now here is a wonderful 1000 piece puzzle if I ever saw one.  Great reflections of the clouds and boats both.  Only thing I don''t like about it is the dark in the bottom left hand corner.  I know you wanted as much of the reflection of the boat as possible, but I wonder if the dark is worth it.  Personally I would have cropped the dark out, rather than have it spoil an otherwise perfect picture.  Man I hate that dark spot.  But I still like the shot and it''s worth a 9.  PTL  I really want to give a 10 but can''t.  I hate that dark spot........', '2003-01-01 19:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180880, 10202, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good use of landscape shot.  Feels like I can almost see the road continuing on and on past the bend.   What kind of vehicle is this?  I sure hope you tell us.  Borders don''t add or subtract as far as I''m concerned.  Looks good here.  Nice choice of colors for it.  Good shot.  Wishing you the best.  Torn on the score.  PTL.  If the colors were bright with a nice blue sky it would be a definite 10.  As is it''s an 8 or 9.  8 for now and I''ll think about it.  PTL</td>', 'Good use of landscape shot.  Feels like I can almost see the road continuing on and on past the bend.   What kind of vehicle is this?  I sure hope you tell us.  Borders don''t add or subtract as far as I''m concerned.  Looks good here.  Nice choice of colors for it.  Good shot.  Wishing you the best.  Torn on the score.  PTL.  If the colors were bright with a nice blue sky it would be a definite 10.  As is it''s an 8 or 9.  8 for now and I''ll think about it.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180884, 10289, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s both.  And it''s a beautiful sky.  Nothing wrong with the photo and nothing really exciting about it wither.  Just a solid good photo worth a 7.  PTL</td>', 'It''s both.  And it''s a beautiful sky.  Nothing wrong with the photo and nothing really exciting about it wither.  Just a solid good photo worth a 7.  PTL', '2003-01-01 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(180886, 10176, 4648, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous of all these snow photos.  Think I''ll go back and give everyone of them a 1.  And this is another good one too.  Nice focus, really nice message on the truck in front of you.  Nice avoidance of glare off the windshield, and that''s not always easy, either.  Nice composition with good execution.  PTL  7</td>', 'I am so jealous of all these snow photos.  Think I''ll go back and give everyone of them a 1.  And this is another good one too.  Nice focus, really nice message on the truck in front of you.  Nice avoidance of glare off the windshield, and that''s not always easy, either.  Nice composition with good execution.  PTL  7', '2003-01-01 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(180888, 10210, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good idea but much, much too busy for me.  And I love the river walk there.  Sorry but I just can''t take the busyness.  It doesn''t even have a theme or outline to look at.  Just a jumble of colored lights.  But, this is just my opinion.  4 PTL</td>', 'Good idea but much, much too busy for me.  And I love the river walk there.  Sorry but I just can''t take the busyness.  It doesn''t even have a theme or outline to look at.  Just a jumble of colored lights.  But, this is just my opinion.  4 PTL', '2003-01-01 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(180890, 10320, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too blurry for me with not real reason for it.  If they are leaning back because it is going up hill then the photo should show them straight and the train or what ever going up hill....Doesn''t appeal to me at all.  1 PTL</td>', 'Too blurry for me with not real reason for it.  If they are leaning back because it is going up hill then the photo should show them straight and the train or what ever going up hill....Doesn''t appeal to me at all.  1 PTL', '2003-01-01 20:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(180892, 10121, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo and the mountains behind add to it.  This place looks so restful.  I''m not good at spanish but kinda looks like a sanitorium.  And I could use a rest there about now.  I love the colors in this.  So typical of that area.  This is a fantastic shot worthy of a 9.  PTL</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo and the mountains behind add to it.  This place looks so restful.  I''m not good at spanish but kinda looks like a sanitorium.  And I could use a rest there about now.  I love the colors in this.  So typical of that area.  This is a fantastic shot worthy of a 9.  PTL', '2003-01-01 20:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(180893, 10240, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute photo but don''t see that it has anything to do with travel, unless they''re screeming because Santa is traveling.  They are precious and the score is not taking anything away from your photography abilities.  I just don''t see it fitting the challenge in any way.  Sorry.  5 PTL  The girls are exceptional models and the portrait is exceptional.  The expressions are worth a million dollars.  Everything about the photo is top notch, except for meeting the challenge.  I hope you understand.</td>', 'Cute photo but don''t see that it has anything to do with travel, unless they''re screeming because Santa is traveling.  They are precious and the score is not taking anything away from your photography abilities.  I just don''t see it fitting the challenge in any way.  Sorry.  5 PTL  The girls are exceptional models and the portrait is exceptional.  The expressions are worth a million dollars.  Everything about the photo is top notch, except for meeting the challenge.  I hope you understand.', '2003-01-01 20:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(180894, 10339, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Everything is right technically.  Can find no fault with your photography ability in this one.  It''s just rather plain.  Nothing exciting.  No great big "wow" so the score won''t be as high as lesser quality photos that have better interest or zing.  PTL 7</td>', 'Good shot.  Everything is right technically.  Can find no fault with your photography ability in this one.  It''s just rather plain.  Nothing exciting.  No great big "wow" so the score won''t be as high as lesser quality photos that have better interest or zing.  PTL 7', '2003-01-01 20:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(180895, 10147, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love airline shots out the windows.  Question - what is the brown on the right hand bottom?  Is that land and snow capped mountains above it?  That''s magnificant.  I didn''t think you could see that clearly at that height.  Top notch photo.  PTL  9</td>', 'I love airline shots out the windows.  Question - what is the brown on the right hand bottom?  Is that land and snow capped mountains above it?  That''s magnificant.  I didn''t think you could see that clearly at that height.  Top notch photo.  PTL  9', '2003-01-01 20:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(180896, 10208, 4648, '<td valign="top">Fantastic view and depth.  That is a long way to be in focus.  I''m impressed.  Just wish I could read the road signs and see where this is.  Really, this is awesome.  Great job.  This should fair well in the challenge.  9 PTL</td>', 'Fantastic view and depth.  That is a long way to be in focus.  I''m impressed.  Just wish I could read the road signs and see where this is.  Really, this is awesome.  Great job.  This should fair well in the challenge.  9 PTL', '2003-01-01 20:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180898, 10301, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Just about everything in focus.  And what an expression on her face.  She looks like a child at play.  Makes me feel good.  I love to see adults having childish fun.  This is a great photo and deserves a score of 9.  PTL</td>', 'Great shot.  Just about everything in focus.  And what an expression on her face.  She looks like a child at play.  Makes me feel good.  I love to see adults having childish fun.  This is a great photo and deserves a score of 9.  PTL', '2003-01-01 20:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180899, 10264, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice one.  The black background works well here.  The money is a nice touch.  Adds color.  Like the teddy bear, excuse me koila bear.  This is a good photo a worthy of an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Nice one.  The black background works well here.  The money is a nice touch.  Adds color.  Like the teddy bear, excuse me koila bear.  This is a good photo a worthy of an 8.  PTL', '2003-01-01 20:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(180900, 10337, 4648, '<td valign="top">You went for the esthetic shot, didn''t you.  Hoping for high scores on beautiful scenery, which i''m a sucker for.  But how does this say travel?  For all i know you may live there and be taking this from your front porch.  If you are, you can expect overnight guests this summer.  Of course this photo is a 10 for it.  I just don''t know that it says travel.  So here is an 8.  PTL</td>', 'You went for the esthetic shot, didn''t you.  Hoping for high scores on beautiful scenery, which i''m a sucker for.  But how does this say travel?  For all i know you may live there and be taking this from your front porch.  If you are, you can expect overnight guests this summer.  Of course this photo is a 10 for it.  I just don''t know that it says travel.  So here is an 8.  PTL', '2003-01-01 20:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180901, 10158, 3724, '<td valign="top">thumbnail star.......  your standing right on the tracks, implies stalking this scene.  It is good though......  rigid lines of tracks, the metal,  imposing train car -  contrast with the snow/fog and people.</td>', 'thumbnail star.......  your standing right on the tracks, implies stalking this scene.  It is good though......  rigid lines of tracks, the metal,  imposing train car -  contrast with the snow/fog and people.', '2003-01-01 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(180903, 10167, 5684, '<td valign="top">it looks like the color depth of the image was reduced and as a result the people in the photo are unclear. The whole gradient shading of the image is ruined.</td>', 'it looks like the color depth of the image was reduced and as a result the people in the photo are unclear. The whole gradient shading of the image is ruined.', '2003-01-01 20:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(180905, 10235, 5684, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I''m trying to think how well it represents travel, but I''m going to give the benefit of the doubt since my jaw dropped when I first viewed this.</td>', 'Awesome. I''m trying to think how well it represents travel, but I''m going to give the benefit of the doubt since my jaw dropped when I first viewed this.', '2003-01-01 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(180906, 10092, 5684, '<td valign="top">Of the photos like this, this is my favorite because of the lighting</td>', 'Of the photos like this, this is my favorite because of the lighting', '2003-01-01 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(180907, 10222, 5684, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo though I wouldnt mind the jet being larger</td>', 'It''s a nice photo though I wouldnt mind the jet being larger', '2003-01-01 20:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(180908, 10188, 5684, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2003-01-01 20:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180909, 10202, 5684, '<td valign="top">I like it though I think you should have kept the whole curve of the road in the photo. 8 overall</td>', 'I like it though I think you should have kept the whole curve of the road in the photo. 8 overall', '2003-01-01 20:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(180910, 10246, 5684, '<td valign="top">This photo really shows the wonder of the child traveling very well. 10 :)</td>', 'This photo really shows the wonder of the child traveling very well. 10 :)', '2003-01-01 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180911, 10257, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too bright.  All the white on the boats is blown out.  Nice depth and good focus.  A very tight shot making it look busy.  Either darken or lower the contrast on this.  Reducing the gamma might help.  It''s worth a try.  PTL 5</td>', 'Too bright.  All the white on the boats is blown out.  Nice depth and good focus.  A very tight shot making it look busy.  Either darken or lower the contrast on this.  Reducing the gamma might help.  It''s worth a try.  PTL 5', '2003-01-01 20:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180912, 10110, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really nice canon.  That camera is still a choice one today.  I have two of the AE-l Programs.  I must have the automatic.  I like how people put money in their photos to show where they are from.  Of course yours doesn''t help me any.  But did you look at the date on that ticket? March 3, 2001.  Hope you didn''t plan to use it on this trip.  Good photo.  Clear enough to read the date, etc.  Good composition and a nice execution.  Good job.  PTL  9</td>', 'Really nice canon.  That camera is still a choice one today.  I have two of the AE-l Programs.  I must have the automatic.  I like how people put money in their photos to show where they are from.  Of course yours doesn''t help me any.  But did you look at the date on that ticket? March 3, 2001.  Hope you didn''t plan to use it on this trip.  Good photo.  Clear enough to read the date, etc.  Good composition and a nice execution.  Good job.  PTL  9', '2003-01-01 20:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(180913, 10250, 4648, '<td valign="top">You really do expect this score of a "1" don''t you.  Is this a joke?  PTL</td>', 'You really do expect this score of a "1" don''t you.  Is this a joke?  PTL', '2003-01-01 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(180921, 10172, 4648, '<td valign="top">No black and white with these beautiful artifacts from Mexico.  You just commited the deadly sin in my book.  Mexican things have such beautiful colors, and I love to see the colors.  Shame, shame.  Went from a 9 down to a 6.  Shame.  PTL  To ahve been a 9 you know it had to be a flauless photo with pizazz.</td>', 'No black and white with these beautiful artifacts from Mexico.  You just commited the deadly sin in my book.  Mexican things have such beautiful colors, and I love to see the colors.  Shame, shame.  Went from a 9 down to a 6.  Shame.  PTL  To ahve been a 9 you know it had to be a flauless photo with pizazz.', '2003-01-01 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(180927, 10308, 4648, '<td valign="top">Without the tiny toddlers on their rides you lose points.  With them, you gain 2 more points.  Sorry.  Now for the photo at hand.  The focus is a little too soft and your colors appear to be off, a bit forced.  The top part of the photo is a little dark.  There''s so much around the taxis the photo is a little busy.  But you do get 5 for the effort.  PTL</td>', 'Without the tiny toddlers on their rides you lose points.  With them, you gain 2 more points.  Sorry.  Now for the photo at hand.  The focus is a little too soft and your colors appear to be off, a bit forced.  The top part of the photo is a little dark.  There''s so much around the taxis the photo is a little busy.  But you do get 5 for the effort.  PTL', '2003-01-01 21:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(180930, 10264, 2752, '<td valign="top">very sharp..uncluttered...and  the destination very well done.</td>', 'very sharp..uncluttered...and  the destination very well done.', '2003-01-01 21:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(180933, 10134, 2752, '<td valign="top">very well done in grayscale..good composition and feeling of peace and quiet.</td>', 'very well done in grayscale..good composition and feeling of peace and quiet.', '2003-01-01 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
