(181018, 10253, 5111, '<td valign="top">One of the first true photo types I generally expected to see. Very well balanced! My only suggestion would have been to edit the gamma/saturation/contrast so as to tone down the valley haze and reduce the brightness of the sky. Still excellent!</td>', 'One of the first true photo types I generally expected to see. Very well balanced! My only suggestion would have been to edit the gamma/saturation/contrast so as to tone down the valley haze and reduce the brightness of the sky. Still excellent!', '2003-01-02 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(181021, 10228, 5822, '<td valign="top">Technically a very well done picture, but not sure I like the pose of the model as it reminds me of a department store advertisement and I see the picrure having more to do with that than travel. Also the foreground is kind of boring.</td>', 'Technically a very well done picture, but not sure I like the pose of the model as it reminds me of a department store advertisement and I see the picrure having more to do with that than travel. Also the foreground is kind of boring.', '2003-01-02 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(181022, 10147, 5111, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Well balanced and toned. Perhaps there should have been just a little less sky but either way worth a 10.</td>', 'Spectacular! Well balanced and toned. Perhaps there should have been just a little less sky but either way worth a 10.', '2003-01-02 00:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(181027, 10332, 5111, '<td valign="top">Well balanced and toned with creativity. I wish there were more to rate like yours =). My only suggestion would have been to sharpen the image a little more to bring out the grass and shack in the foreground. Excellent!</td>', 'Well balanced and toned with creativity. I wish there were more to rate like yours =). My only suggestion would have been to sharpen the image a little more to bring out the grass and shack in the foreground. Excellent!', '2003-01-02 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
