(181186, 10228, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting &amp; exposure and color of this image. It would do great in a travel magazine when the background was a bit more interesting.<br/>Good detail.<br/>8</td>', 'I like the lighting & exposure and color of this image. It would do great in a travel magazine when the background was a bit more interesting.Good detail.8', '2003-01-02 05:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(181187, 10094, 3032, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and colors. Good DOF, exposure etc.<br/>The background is a bit empty, but that also focusses attention to the bridge.<br/>When it is doing bad in the challenge, it is perhaps that is was a bit hard to see that the central line of light was caused by cars passing. I only saw that the second time.<br/>Good photo.<br/></td>', 'Like the composition and colors. Good DOF, exposure etc.The background is a bit empty, but that also focusses attention to the bridge.When it is doing bad in the challenge, it is perhaps that is was a bit hard to see that the central line of light was caused by cars passing. I only saw that the second time.Good photo.', '2003-01-02 05:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(181189, 10215, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur. It does a good job at telling the story of the person in the frame. Could be that he/she was just walking, but the way the picture is done it says: Gotta run, I am late!!!</td>', 'I like the motion blur. It does a good job at telling the story of the person in the frame. Could be that he/she was just walking, but the way the picture is done it says: Gotta run, I am late!!!', '2003-01-02 05:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
