(181404, 10260, 5508, '<td valign="top">For this challenge I have not been giving high marks for destination shots, only pics that deal with travelling. However this one deserves high marks regardless. But I guess you can look at it as travel, ships do need light houses don''t they?<br/>Great job.</td>', 'For this challenge I have not been giving high marks for destination shots, only pics that deal with travelling. However this one deserves high marks regardless. But I guess you can look at it as travel, ships do need light houses don''t they?Great job.', '2003-01-02 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
