(181412, 10134, 2903, '<td valign="top">Picture looked good until the car loaded.  The idea would''ve been captured without the car, let the tracks make the people use their imagination.  LESS IS MORE.  And watch out for those signs on the right.</td>', 'Picture looked good until the car loaded.  The idea would''ve been captured without the car, let the tracks make the people use their imagination.  LESS IS MORE.  And watch out for those signs on the right.', '2003-01-02 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(181415, 10148, 2903, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it</td>', 'I don''t get it', '2003-01-02 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(181416, 10235, 5896, '<td valign="top">A nice composition, well balanced light and an interesting object challenging the viewer to what the actual scale might be. Regardless of the objects true function it gives a poetic image of technology.</td>', 'A nice composition, well balanced light and an interesting object challenging the viewer to what the actual scale might be. Regardless of the objects true function it gives a poetic image of technology.', '2003-01-02 17:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(181421, 10217, 5896, '<td valign="top">Nice picture with the colours of the donkey contrasting with the dust filled background. The image is a good comment to the theme of the gallery, being composed of the meeting between two travellers: the beast of burden and the photographer.</td>', 'Nice picture with the colours of the donkey contrasting with the dust filled background. The image is a good comment to the theme of the gallery, being composed of the meeting between two travellers: the beast of burden and the photographer.', '2003-01-02 17:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(181423, 10102, 5896, '<td valign="top">No composition, no particular lighting situation, no movement...simply boring!</td>', 'No composition, no particular lighting situation, no movement...simply boring!', '2003-01-02 17:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(181425, 10157, 5896, '<td valign="top">Good comment to the theme of the gallery. Working with movement is interesting but difficult.</td>', 'Good comment to the theme of the gallery. Working with movement is interesting but difficult.', '2003-01-02 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(181427, 10271, 5896, '<td valign="top">Was this the best of the lot? Since it seems to have been taken with a purpose rather than at the spure of a moment, this picture should have been better.</td>', 'Was this the best of the lot? Since it seems to have been taken with a purpose rather than at the spure of a moment, this picture should have been better.', '2003-01-02 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(181428, 10274, 5896, '<td valign="top">A nice picture capturing the essence of the beginning of a journey.</td>', 'A nice picture capturing the essence of the beginning of a journey.', '2003-01-02 17:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(181430, 10236, 5896, '<td valign="top">The only reference to travel is the name of the entry giving a hint to the three wise men. As a photograph it doesn''t have any qualities besides being somewhat cute.</td>', 'The only reference to travel is the name of the entry giving a hint to the three wise men. As a photograph it doesn''t have any qualities besides being somewhat cute.', '2003-01-02 17:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(181435, 10294, 5896, '<td valign="top">I like pictures of technology. Apart from this positive preference of mine there''s nothing special about this picture and the composition is disturbed by the fragment of text in the upper right corner.</td>', 'I like pictures of technology. Apart from this positive preference of mine there''s nothing special about this picture and the composition is disturbed by the fragment of text in the upper right corner.', '2003-01-02 17:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(181436, 10215, 5896, '<td valign="top">The choise of portraying movement is interesting but the image doesn''t have any qualities besides this.</td>', 'The choise of portraying movement is interesting but the image doesn''t have any qualities besides this.', '2003-01-02 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(181437, 10208, 5896, '<td valign="top">The only thing interesting about this picture is how the photographer got to where the shot was taken...</td>', 'The only thing interesting about this picture is how the photographer got to where the shot was taken...', '2003-01-02 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(181438, 10134, 3279, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have preferred it without the car, but it''s still a nice shot!</td>', 'I think I''d have preferred it without the car, but it''s still a nice shot!', '2003-01-02 17:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(181439, 10122, 5896, '<td valign="top">It''s very difficult to take good pictures of celestial objects and that gives credit to this picture. Otherwise I think the picture should stand on its own merits in relation to the theme and not through the naming of the image.</td>', 'It''s very difficult to take good pictures of celestial objects and that gives credit to this picture. Otherwise I think the picture should stand on its own merits in relation to the theme and not through the naming of the image.', '2003-01-02 17:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(181440, 10105, 5896, '<td valign="top">A crisp photo with a difficult motive.</td>', 'A crisp photo with a difficult motive.', '2003-01-02 17:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(181441, 10232, 5896, '<td valign="top">Ontario seems to be a nice place, but ducks are to be found everywhere. It''s not a very interesting picture as such.</td>', 'Ontario seems to be a nice place, but ducks are to be found everywhere. It''s not a very interesting picture as such.', '2003-01-02 18:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(181442, 10291, 5896, '<td valign="top">It seems to be a nice place and a nice time of year but the picture isn''t very interesting. The symmetry between the boat and its reflection actually makes the picture more static than need be.</td>', 'It seems to be a nice place and a nice time of year but the picture isn''t very interesting. The symmetry between the boat and its reflection actually makes the picture more static than need be.', '2003-01-02 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(181443, 10095, 5896, '<td valign="top">Interesting motive. The picture is  too static though and the blue colour is a bit overbearing.</td>', 'Interesting motive. The picture is  too static though and the blue colour is a bit overbearing.', '2003-01-02 18:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(181444, 10172, 5896, '<td valign="top">An arranged setting of boring items = twice as boring.</td>', 'An arranged setting of boring items = twice as boring.', '2003-01-02 18:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(181446, 10251, 4615, '<td valign="top">meets challenge 100%  For millions of people, this is what travel looks like.  But, as someone once said, "in art, what is not interesting, is not true".  I give 7.<br/></td>', 'meets challenge 100%  For millions of people, this is what travel looks like.  But, as someone once said, "in art, what is not interesting, is not true".  I give 7.', '2003-01-02 18:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(181447, 10089, 5896, '<td valign="top">A nice composition with contrasts between high vs. low, colour vs. whiteness and technology vs. nature.</td>', 'A nice composition with contrasts between high vs. low, colour vs. whiteness and technology vs. nature.', '2003-01-02 18:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(181448, 10210, 5896, '<td valign="top">San Antonio seems to be a nice place, but I think the picture would have been more interesting if it had been centered on the reflections in the river instead of the lights as such.</td>', 'San Antonio seems to be a nice place, but I think the picture would have been more interesting if it had been centered on the reflections in the river instead of the lights as such.', '2003-01-02 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(181449, 10160, 4615, '<td valign="top">The frame is way too heavy, totally overwhelms the picture.  I put some things around the edge to see what it would look like w/o the frame-definate improvement.  Its a good picture, conveys the lonelyness of the road.</td>', 'The frame is way too heavy, totally overwhelms the picture.  I put some things around the edge to see what it would look like w/o the frame-definate improvement.  Its a good picture, conveys the lonelyness of the road.', '2003-01-02 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(181450, 10180, 5896, '<td valign="top">Nice weather...</td>', 'Nice weather...', '2003-01-02 18:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(181451, 10237, 1005, '<td valign="top">No - the quote should read  "I am too stupid to take a picture of travel".  Minus an extra point for improper english.  (Add it back if this isn''t your primary language)<br/>4 Swash  (minus 6 for effort, but plus 1 as you made me chuckle for a second ;)<br/>Oh yes, I''m sure you know this too, but dum is really spelled dumb, but you were probably going for another laugh.  (I hope)</td>', 'No - the quote should read  "I am too stupid to take a picture of travel".  Minus an extra point for improper english.  (Add it back if this isn''t your primary language)4 Swash  (minus 6 for effort, but plus 1 as you made me chuckle for a second ;)Oh yes, I''m sure you know this too, but dum is really spelled dumb, but you were probably going for another laugh.  (I hope)', '2003-01-02 18:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(181452, 10170, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful shot!  The far wing is slight out of focus, but I''ve done enough butterflies to know how impossible that is!  Less than common wing angle, even though it''s harder to see the patterns, I like it.  Very good, natural color.<br/>10 all the way!  Swash</td>', 'Wow, beautiful shot!  The far wing is slight out of focus, but I''ve done enough butterflies to know how impossible that is!  Less than common wing angle, even though it''s harder to see the patterns, I like it.  Very good, natural color.10 all the way!  Swash', '2003-01-02 18:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(181453, 10196, 4615, '<td valign="top">Theres an odd feeling to this picture, which comes from the fact the silloette suggests evening, while the blue sky suggests mid-day.</td>', 'Theres an odd feeling to this picture, which comes from the fact the silloette suggests evening, while the blue sky suggests mid-day.', '2003-01-02 18:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(181456, 10337, 1005, '<td valign="top">But for the grain in ths sky and the slightly overly blue (cyan) sky this is a fantastic photo!  I started to offer this a 10, but those two factors wouldn''t let me.  Beautiful 9.  Swash</td>', 'But for the grain in ths sky and the slightly overly blue (cyan) sky this is a fantastic photo!  I started to offer this a 10, but those two factors wouldn''t let me.  Beautiful 9.  Swash', '2003-01-02 18:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(181457, 10101, 5896, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo opportunity. The lack of image quality is understandable.</td>', 'Very interesting photo opportunity. The lack of image quality is understandable.', '2003-01-02 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(181458, 10196, 2158, '<td valign="top">Creative entry.  I really like it.</td>', 'Creative entry.  I really like it.', '2003-01-02 18:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(181459, 10291, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, gorgeous picture!  While a moored boat isn''t quite my idea of travel, I do get the idea and the reflection would have never been as nice in motion, so I like it.  Small nit:  the mast reflection is grounded, a slightly different angle would have placed the end of the mast in the water, complete.  9 Swash</td>', 'Wow, gorgeous picture!  While a moored boat isn''t quite my idea of travel, I do get the idea and the reflection would have never been as nice in motion, so I like it.  Small nit:  the mast reflection is grounded, a slightly different angle would have placed the end of the mast in the water, complete.  9 Swash', '2003-01-02 18:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(181460, 10298, 5896, '<td valign="top">Nice moment captured. The picture tells a story.</td>', 'Nice moment captured. The picture tells a story.', '2003-01-02 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(181462, 10229, 4615, '<td valign="top">at least they let you drink.   Really should see a face in this.  There appears to be no subject, which makes for a very non-impactful shot. Yes, I know there''s a paradox there, when what your trying to show is the ennui or boredom of waiting in airports.</td>', 'at least they let you drink.   Really should see a face in this.  There appears to be no subject, which makes for a very non-impactful shot. Yes, I know there''s a paradox there, when what your trying to show is the ennui or boredom of waiting in airports.', '2003-01-02 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(181463, 10126, 3735, '<td valign="top">The front one is an Appaloosa, are the other two white ones Appaloosa''s also? wish i could see the other one. Want to know if it is a Quarter horse or Rocky Mountain . sorry I am just thanking out loud lol.  any way good photo  10</td>', 'The front one is an Appaloosa, are the other two white ones Appaloosa''s also? wish i could see the other one. Want to know if it is a Quarter horse or Rocky Mountain . sorry I am just thanking out loud lol.  any way good photo  10', '2003-01-02 18:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(181464, 10268, 4615, '<td valign="top">very poetic-which is nice for a change here.</td>', 'very poetic-which is nice for a change here.', '2003-01-02 18:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(181465, 10202, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  The biker''s placement in the shot is great, the road ahead!  If I had any wish for this shot, it would be to see the road trail off into the distance, but please I know that''s asking for the world, so don''t worry it.  The biker seems ever so slightly out of focus, but not enough to worry over either.  Maybe a slightly faster shutter.  9 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot.  The biker''s placement in the shot is great, the road ahead!  If I had any wish for this shot, it would be to see the road trail off into the distance, but please I know that''s asking for the world, so don''t worry it.  The biker seems ever so slightly out of focus, but not enough to worry over either.  Maybe a slightly faster shutter.  9 Swash', '2003-01-02 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(181466, 10182, 5896, '<td valign="top">Blurred composition and static motive. The funny lights really doesn''t do the trick.</td>', 'Blurred composition and static motive. The funny lights really doesn''t do the trick.', '2003-01-02 18:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
