(181470, 10105, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I would have liked it a bit larger and cropped alot more on the bottom.  The faces in the corner are really distracting and the street lights don''t help either.  Still, ignoring the lower 1/8 it would be a 10, so I''ll go a 9.  Swash</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I would have liked it a bit larger and cropped alot more on the bottom.  The faces in the corner are really distracting and the street lights don''t help either.  Still, ignoring the lower 1/8 it would be a 10, so I''ll go a 9.  Swash', '2003-01-02 18:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
