(181472, 10147, 1005, '<td valign="top">Now, how did you get such a clear window?  I''ve been on several trips and never have I seen a window that I could photograph though!  Great view.  Challenge hit!  9 Swash</td>', 'Now, how did you get such a clear window?  I''ve been on several trips and never have I seen a window that I could photograph though!  Great view.  Challenge hit!  9 Swash', '2003-01-02 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
