(181478, 10132, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice view!  What is the bright thing streaking across the sky?  Very colorful!  Easy 9.  Swash</td>', 'Wow, nice view!  What is the bright thing streaking across the sky?  Very colorful!  Easy 9.  Swash', '2003-01-02 18:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
