(181482, 10230, 1005, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong with the classics!  Very nice!  Small nit:  the street lights in the lower left corner, not needed.  In fact, it looks like there''s a barrier of some sort along the bottom first four arches (from the right lower corner).  Crop it all.<br/>Still, very, very nice!!! 9 Swash</td>', 'Can''t go wrong with the classics!  Very nice!  Small nit:  the street lights in the lower left corner, not needed.  In fact, it looks like there''s a barrier of some sort along the bottom first four arches (from the right lower corner).  Crop it all.Still, very, very nice!!! 9 Swash', '2003-01-02 18:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(181483, 10279, 3735, '<td valign="top">yes i would keep that behind bar''s also very nice</td>', 'yes i would keep that behind bar''s also very nice', '2003-01-02 18:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(181484, 10295, 3735, '<td valign="top">looks lonely</td>', 'looks lonely', '2003-01-02 18:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
