(182934, 10169, 4411, '<td valign="top">A fairly dull shot. The subject is dead centre in the frame which doesn''t work for me, and the background doesn''t add much to the shot.<br/>I would have cropped a lot tighter into the hitch-hiker, probably in portrait format, keeping him to the right of the frame.</td>', 'A fairly dull shot. The subject is dead centre in the frame which doesn''t work for me, and the background doesn''t add much to the shot.I would have cropped a lot tighter into the hitch-hiker, probably in portrait format, keeping him to the right of the frame.', '2003-01-05 20:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
