(183087, 10195, 674, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/>Composition &amp; Background -Good the focus is spot on the depth of field is good and the background compliments the image with out detracting from it.<br/> <br/> Camera work Good lighting and focusing spot on.<br/> Digital processing I like the duotone may be not quite contrasty enough.<br/>My Opinion I liked this image a lot but then Iam a sucker for horses! Seriously I thought it very good and fitted the challenge as to me a travel photo should include some form of transport.<br/></td>', 'Critique ClubComposition & Background -Good the focus is spot on the depth of field is good and the background compliments the image with out detracting from it.  Camera work Good lighting and focusing spot on. Digital processing I like the duotone may be not quite contrasty enough.My Opinion I liked this image a lot but then Iam a sucker for horses! Seriously I thought it very good and fitted the challenge as to me a travel photo should include some form of transport.', '2003-01-06 00:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(183098, 10201, 674, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/>Composition A nice photo but I think it would have been improved by cropping the right hand side off at the tree.<br/>Camera work I think the ev could have been set down a little perhaps bracketing would have helped<br/>My Opinion A nice vacation Photograph which doesnt say travel to me! How did you get there if there was some indication in the photo even just a hiking bag!<br/></td>', 'Critique ClubComposition A nice photo but I think it would have been improved by cropping the right hand side off at the tree.Camera work I think the ev could have been set down a little perhaps bracketing would have helpedMy Opinion A nice vacation Photograph which doesnt say travel to me! How did you get there if there was some indication in the photo even just a hiking bag!', '2003-01-06 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
