(183122, 10232, 674, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>My Opinion This is an alright shot but the bright water in the foreground has totaly thrown the cameras metering system. The background is more in focus than the forground and the ducks are too dark and the water too bright I dont see any reference to travel in this photo it could just be the duck pond in your neighborhood park.<br/>I hope your camera has been fixed as it is a good camera with a nice range of options. <br/></td>', 'Critique Club My Opinion This is an alright shot but the bright water in the foreground has totaly thrown the cameras metering system. The background is more in focus than the forground and the ducks are too dark and the water too bright I dont see any reference to travel in this photo it could just be the duck pond in your neighborhood park.I hope your camera has been fixed as it is a good camera with a nice range of options. ', '2003-01-06 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
