(3988233, 10260, 38267, '<td valign="top">Love the beach and I grew up in Hampton Roads, although I live in San Francisco now.  Very familiar with this lighthouse ;).  Great shot. Thanks for commenting on my "Cinco" shot earlier today in the "Pick your favorite from the person above..." thread.  You asked about the birds, they are actually Willets I believe...not sure actually.  They are pretty common out here in beaches of NorCal.  Take it easy!</td>', 'Love the beach and I grew up in Hampton Roads, although I live in San Francisco now.  Very familiar with this lighthouse ;).  Great shot. Thanks for commenting on my "Cinco" shot earlier today in the "Pick your favorite from the person above..." thread.  You asked about the birds, they are actually Willets I believe...not sure actually.  They are pretty common out here in beaches of NorCal.  Take it easy!', '2007-08-11 02:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
